  <span class="os-title-label">Figure </span>
<span class="os-number">6.3</span>



  <span class="os-divider"> </span>
  <span class="os-caption">The intensity of blackbody radiation versus the wavelength of the emitted radiation. Each curve corresponds to a different blackbody temperature, starting with a low temperature (the lowest curve) to a high temperature (the highest curve).</span>
